  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1502.05 Railroad Company Estimated Railroad Tax. Pursuant to RSA 82:20, III, railroad companies having an annual projected tax liability in excess of $200 shall complete and file Form DP-110-ES, “Estimated Railroad Tax” quarterly and accompanied by the estimate payment.\n\nSource. #8652, eff 6-6-06; ss by #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1500.html"
